"P2005063705" "Patience is a virtue the living can never truly possess, and I do not expect it from you.<em>The dead, however, often have a great love of patience, to a fault sometimes.<em>I will call the others to the council fire and then you shall hear what is truth..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P674060415" "You must help the spirits of the living to find peace.<em>Only then will south once again be  south."
