// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound2_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P458496253" "Have Cerulean examine the Book of Binding"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2370456198" "Cerulean will need to read the Book of Binding to find the correct spell."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2391578340" "<color orange>Cerulean examines the Book of Binding, quickly flipping between pages before settling on one.</color><br><br>Here, this is the ritual that Makwa needs. I will get to work on it immediately. Inform him that he will need a subject for the Dust of Chains to use as a basis for the magical ward's parameters. I believe he has a <color yellow>spirit snare</color>. It should be useful in acquiring what is needed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4153520295" "<color orange>Blind Makwa chuckles as you relay Cerulean's message.</color><br><br>Yes, I anticipated the need of my <color yellow>spirit snare</color>. With the Dust of Chains and your abilities I foresee no difficulty in protecting ourselves from these Apparitions.<br><br>But there is still work to be done and we should move quickly, the wind can blow west at a moment's notice, and in that direction there is only death and sorrow."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - BlindMakwaDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P343402632" "<color deepskyblue>Dark Visions</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Finale: The Dark Host</color><br><br>I sense a dark magic on these spirits, {HeroName}. Very dark magic. Something is driving these spirits to do ill will toward men, but I cannot place it.<br><br><color orange>Cerulean is ready for us to begin the Binding Ritual and to place the Spirit Wards.</color> When you are ready we will begin. I have a feeling in my bones that the Apparitions will react violently to our spell and I would be comforted if you were present."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P231663071" "Before Cerulean and I can construct <color yellow>Spirit Wards</color> to protect the Chapel I must have a greater knowledge of the relationship between the Apparitions and the people they possess. <color orange>To accomplish this you must use my spirit snare on the Possessed in order to draw out the spirits within, while they are cohabitating a single body. However, while the Possessed seem to flock to the Mercyview Cemetery at night, they do not dawdle there during the day.</color> It will be a dangerous task, let there be no doubt in that."
// AcceptString :
"P2867211760" "I'll gather the spirits you seek."
// SendOffString :
"P3301792500" "The relationship between Apparition and it's possessed host is what is key to the magic I seek to make. Normally the snare is used on ghosts free of any physical vessel, but I have used the Dust of Chains to modify it to bind portions of the Possessed host and Apparition together inside the Spirit Snare.<br><br><color orange>You will have to weaken the Possessed before the Apparition within will start to seek escape, then you can use the Spirit Snare to capture the essence of both souls.</color> Once you have snared seven spirits we can get started on the wards.<br><br>Go forward with courage, and remember, <color orange>they only come out at night</color>."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1124112075" "<color deepskyblue>Part Five: Splitting Souls</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound3_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4276161625" "Ensnare Possessed in the Mercyview Cemetery at night"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3651004194" "<color orange>The Possessed only come out at night. Once you find them you will have to weaken them before the Apparition within will start to seek escape, then you can use the Spirit Snare to capture the essence of both souls.</color> Once you have acquired the seven spirits return to me."
// tokenprogressstring :
"P1436435658" "You have ensnared {token} of 7 spirits of the Possessed"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1308449491" "You've ensnared seven spirits!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound3_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3768124395" "Set up the Spirit Wards"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2401150103" "If the Spirit Wards are not set up soon then I fear the Apparitions, driven by the dark magic within them, will overwhelm us all."

